# This machine's operational artifacts, deliberately NOT in the repository: which core this box keeps offline
# and why, the units that re-apply it and archive the machine-check record, and this box's physical protocols.
# They are not generic health checks -- they name this chassis, its slots and its faults. The tools they run
# (tools/journal-pcie.py, tools/mca-hazard.py, tools/brief.py, ...) are in the repo; the instructions for this
# box are not.
host/offline-core.cpus
host/r9700-offline-core.sh
host/r9700-offline-core.service
host/r9700-mca-archive.service
notes/incident-*/protocol-local.md
host/local-*.md
